nder-latency","text":"Recommender latency after a deploy (cache stampede). # Runbook: recommender latency after a deploy\n\nA latency jump on recommender right after one of its deploys is almost always a cache stampede: the new\nbuild changed cache keys and every request recomputes.\n\nContain first: switch the recommenderRail flag off so product pages stop calling recommender, then roll the\ndeploy back or let the cache warm with recommenderCacheWarmup on. Confirm recommender latency is back\ninside its band before turning the rail on again.","embedding":[-0.059893,0.041829,0.009618,0.002098,-0.031731,-0.031572,-0.000425,0.00192,0.029787,-0.037913,0.047237,-0.013135,0.030266,0.066873,-0.018583,0.078809,0.018543,-0.033969,0.023605,-0.09229,0.017677,-0.015306,0.016159,-0.013814,-0.018903,0.038712,-0.040097,-0.071509,-0.071989,-0.177653,-0.045079,-0.088507,0.002115,-0.01065,0.006224,-0.014893,0.01075,0.049529,0.037779,0.064795,-0.014081,0.074386,0.009085,-0.030746,0.000467,-0.035328,0.045852,-0.051367,0.02174,0.037859,0.02928,-0.038872,0.070923,-0.012209,0.005075,-0.007333,0.070656,0.090692,-0.02218,-0.004606,0.075985,-0.003507,-0.112539,0.040124,0.054005,-0.037806,-0.054191,-0.077743,-0.035008,0.083924,0.028801,0.040577,-0.037699,0.031705,0.065115,0.034982,0.015746,0.0738,0.059147,0.038659,-0.052832,-0.003132,-0.038339,-0.073161,0.036287,-0.029094,0.030266,0.008765,0.035701,0.028348,0.003787,-0.01885,0.028614,0.051314,-0.110301,-0.028721,-0.014054,0.032318,-0.031731,0.354028,-0.009019,0.008732,-0.018836,0.053392,0.012142,-0.064848,0.05499,0.017624,0.025311,0.051394,0.018437,0.031199,0.054058,-0.039911,0.023086,0.039218,0.00371,0.050728,0.03658,0.04087,0.019636,0.023725,0.04119,0.001481,0.040257,0.026083,0.011843,0.033277,-0.007926,-0.036287,-0.000878,-0.059626,-0.026776,0.023392,-0.002987,0.020009,-0.030026,-0.035355,0.048889,0.001848,0.008945,0.012542,0.058081,-0.021527,0.00762,0.042948,0.019875,0.025604,-0.061491,-0.017078,-0.055736,0.013694,0.016319,-0.017757,0.01